WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:37.580
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:37.850 --> 01:43.060
[Shadow Punisher]

3
01:43.110 --> 01:43.660
[Divine Constable Tally]

4
01:43.690 --> 01:45.890
[Episode 8]

5
02:12.560 --> 02:13.400
As expected,

6
02:14.080 --> 02:15.470
at this time of year,

7
02:15.550 --> 02:17.280
this is the only place around Tianhuang City

8
02:17.280 --> 02:19.400
where Dragon-whisker Grass

9
02:19.840 --> 02:20.970
can be found.

10
02:30.710 --> 02:32.000
The autopsy results for Yan Zige

11
02:32.000 --> 02:32.840
are in.

12
02:35.960 --> 02:36.770
How did it go?

13
02:36.829 --> 02:39.230
I'm afraid the results may disappoint you.

14
02:40.870 --> 02:41.910
The ventricles were intact,

15
02:41.910 --> 02:43.590
and there were no other signs of illness.

16
02:43.590 --> 02:45.680
The only explanation is that he died from external trauma.

17
02:45.680 --> 02:46.800
But Meng Rui,

18
02:46.910 --> 02:47.840
as I told you,

19
02:48.430 --> 02:50.240
you're honest and straightforward by nature.

20
02:50.240 --> 02:51.840
You couldn't possibly be the killer.

21
02:51.840 --> 02:52.630
So

22
02:53.310 --> 02:54.150
whether you consider me

23
02:54.150 --> 02:55.240
a friend or not,

24
02:55.560 --> 02:56.360
I

25
02:56.450 --> 02:58.850
will help you get to the bottom of the truth.

26
02:59.000 --> 02:59.800
Meng Rui,

27
03:00.190 --> 03:01.800
Tell me about your master.

28
03:04.150 --> 03:05.590
When I had nowhere to go,

29
03:05.800 --> 03:06.910
he took me in

30
03:07.120 --> 03:08.650
and taught me martial arts.

31
03:08.680 --> 03:10.540
I only learned these past few days

32
03:10.870 --> 03:13.530
that he was known as the Netherworld Swordsman.

33
03:13.630 --> 03:15.360
Why did you have nowhere to go?

34
03:17.190 --> 03:18.560
When did this happen?

35
03:19.190 --> 03:20.590
The 20th year of Hongyun.

36
03:23.280 --> 03:24.079
Why?

37
03:24.710 --> 03:26.640
Were you an orphan from a young age?

38
03:28.120 --> 03:29.310
I'm not an orphan.

39
03:30.190 --> 03:31.850
Then what about your parents?

40
03:32.240 --> 03:33.640
Do you have any siblings?

41
03:36.560 --> 03:38.680
Is the Netherworld Swordsman still alive?

42
03:38.680 --> 03:39.470
He's dead.

43
03:40.560 --> 03:41.560
Are you sure?

44
03:41.590 --> 03:42.870
I buried him myself.

45
03:43.840 --> 03:44.900
If that's the case,

46
03:45.630 --> 03:47.750
I'm afraid the real culprit behind the black chest case

47
03:47.750 --> 03:49.310
intended from the very beginning

48
03:49.310 --> 03:50.079
to use the legend

49
03:50.079 --> 03:51.960
of the Netherworld Swordsman

50
03:52.150 --> 03:54.150
to create the black chest warnings.

51
03:56.310 --> 03:58.170
Based on your Severe-Cold Sword,

52
03:58.190 --> 03:59.270
they deduced

53
03:59.470 --> 04:00.210
that you were

54
04:00.240 --> 04:02.150
the heir to the Netherworld Swordsman.

55
04:02.150 --> 04:02.960
So they began

56
04:04.910 --> 04:06.780
carefully laying their plans,

57
04:06.910 --> 04:08.710
intending to pin the whole thing

58
04:09.240 --> 04:10.520
on you.

59
04:10.580 --> 04:12.070
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

60
04:25.890 --> 04:27.710
[Retreat of Bamboo and Pine]

61
04:30.430 --> 04:31.510
Chief.

62
04:34.720 --> 04:35.510
Zhenzhu.

63
04:36.430 --> 04:38.360
If you can't make sense of things,

64
04:38.600 --> 04:39.600
you should go home

65
04:39.720 --> 04:41.240
and spend some time with your father.

66
04:41.240 --> 04:42.240
If the culprit really

67
04:42.240 --> 04:44.430
is connected to the Netherworld Swordsman,

68
04:44.430 --> 04:46.120
I suspect their revenge

69
04:46.120 --> 04:47.159
isn't over yet.

70
04:47.750 --> 04:49.510
Their next target

71
04:50.720 --> 04:53.950
will be the person who joined forces with the imperial court

72
04:53.950 --> 04:54.950
and the martial world to hunt down the Netherworld Swordsman

73
04:54.950 --> 04:56.390
back then.

74
04:56.750 --> 04:57.720
In other words,

75
05:00.040 --> 05:00.830
my father.

76
05:01.390 --> 05:02.630
Xuanyuan Shan said

77
05:03.240 --> 05:05.750
that Northern Kun was forced to join forces with the Great Shi

78
05:05.750 --> 05:07.160
and, together with Grand Secretary Bai,

79
05:07.160 --> 05:08.110
issued an order

80
05:08.110 --> 05:10.370
to hunt down the Netherworld Swordsman.

81
05:11.310 --> 05:12.640
Grand Secretary Bai Qi?

82
05:13.720 --> 05:15.850
The Divine Constable Bureau matters,

83
05:16.190 --> 05:17.360
of course,

84
05:18.240 --> 05:19.640
but family matters, too.

85
05:22.430 --> 05:25.030
Lately, I've been wondering about something.

86
05:25.040 --> 05:26.440
Who really stands to gain

87
05:26.630 --> 05:28.300
from Wenbu's death?

88
05:29.120 --> 05:30.920
I've even suspected the First Prince

89
05:30.920 --> 05:32.120
and the Crown Prince.

90
05:33.600 --> 05:34.390
Li Si,

91
05:35.120 --> 05:36.390
investigating them for my sake

92
05:36.390 --> 05:37.650
puts you at great risk.

93
05:38.070 --> 05:38.870
Actually,

94
05:39.600 --> 05:41.600
I'm not doing this entirely for you.

95
05:41.720 --> 05:42.510
There are things

96
05:42.510 --> 05:43.909
I want to find out myself.

97
05:45.390 --> 05:46.190
Why don't we

98
05:47.190 --> 05:48.870
look at it from another angle?

99
05:49.800 --> 05:50.600
Go on.

100
05:51.190 --> 05:52.920
If someone wanted to recreate the circumstances

101
05:52.920 --> 05:55.159
in the black chest warning exactly and kill someone that way,

102
05:55.159 --> 05:57.180
how difficult would that be?

103
05:57.310 --> 05:58.950
Wenbu's timing of taking the poison

104
05:58.950 --> 06:00.720
could be chalked up to luck.

105
06:00.870 --> 06:01.900
But...

106
06:02.120 --> 06:03.920
Yan Zige's death was different.

107
06:04.110 --> 06:05.040
Neither he nor I knew

108
06:05.040 --> 06:06.900
what move would be used in the end—

109
06:06.920 --> 06:08.750
whether it would be a palm strike or a sword strike.

110
06:08.750 --> 06:10.410
Yet how could that black chest

111
06:10.600 --> 06:12.270
possibly know in advance,

112
06:12.290 --> 06:14.270
with such precision,

113
06:14.300 --> 06:16.800
that Yan Zige would be killed by a single palm strike from you?

114
06:16.800 --> 06:18.580
The real culprit went to all that trouble

115
06:18.580 --> 06:20.440
to create the black chest warning

116
06:20.560 --> 06:22.160
just to frame me?

117
06:22.510 --> 06:23.390
Why?

118
06:23.560 --> 06:26.290
What grudge could they possibly have against me?

119
06:30.950 --> 06:33.120
What if we look at it the other way around?

120
06:33.120 --> 06:34.070
The other way around?

121
06:34.070 --> 06:35.150
What if

122
06:35.720 --> 06:36.800
the black chest

123
06:37.000 --> 06:38.070
wasn't merely meant

124
06:38.070 --> 06:40.130
to frame the Netherworld Swordsman,

125
06:40.360 --> 06:42.120
but the warning itself

126
06:42.510 --> 06:43.800
was an essential part

127
06:43.800 --> 06:45.680
of the killer's method of murder?

128
06:49.560 --> 06:50.390
You're saying

129
06:50.560 --> 06:51.800
you met Mr. Meng?

130
06:51.800 --> 06:52.800
Don't worry.

131
06:53.190 --> 06:54.390
He's doing just fine.

132
06:54.560 --> 06:55.690
Did he say anything?

133
06:57.040 --> 06:57.830
Zhenzhu,

134
06:57.950 --> 06:59.190
there's something

135
06:59.190 --> 07:00.390
I've been wondering.

136
07:01.160 --> 07:02.290
Were Yan Zige's ribs

137
07:02.600 --> 07:04.070
broken?

138
07:04.800 --> 07:05.560
No.

139
07:12.120 --> 07:13.680
I found that strange

140
07:14.190 --> 07:15.920
when I examined the body earlier.

141
07:15.920 --> 07:17.800
No matter how profound Meng Rui's inner power was,

142
07:17.800 --> 07:18.950
there was no way

143
07:19.000 --> 07:20.720
he could have shattered the heart meridians

144
07:20.720 --> 07:22.600
through the intact ribs without leaving a mark on them.

145
07:22.600 --> 07:23.580
Exactly.

146
07:24.270 --> 07:25.740
That proves

147
07:25.920 --> 07:29.050
Yan Zige couldn't possibly have been killed by Meng Rui.

148
07:29.270 --> 07:30.650
I'll go check again.

149
07:31.360 --> 07:32.150
Li Si,

150
07:33.120 --> 07:33.920
thank you.

151
07:37.430 --> 07:38.240
Go ahead.

152
07:40.720 --> 07:42.050
Your Highness, please,

153
07:42.270 --> 07:43.600
don't drink anymore.

154
07:43.600 --> 07:44.600
Watch your step.

155
07:47.310 --> 07:49.630
Your Highness, let's go back to the Crown Prince's residence.

156
07:49.630 --> 07:50.230
No, no, no.

157
07:50.260 --> 07:52.720
Your Highness, you've had too much to drink.

158
07:53.360 --> 07:54.390
I'm not drunk.

159
07:54.750 --> 07:55.950
You are. You're drunk.

160
07:55.950 --> 07:57.070
I'm not drunk.

161
07:58.310 --> 07:59.560
I'm not drunk.

162
08:01.070 --> 08:02.120
Have you heard?

163
08:02.720 --> 08:03.510
With the war

164
08:03.750 --> 08:05.870
against Northern Kun upon us,

165
08:06.140 --> 08:08.930
says the Ministry of War under my command

166
08:09.000 --> 08:10.390
holds the most power.

167
08:10.390 --> 08:11.190
But!

168
08:11.190 --> 08:11.750
No, no, no.

169
08:11.750 --> 08:12.950
None of you know!

170
08:12.950 --> 08:13.920
Y-Your Highness, you've had too much to drink.

171
08:13.920 --> 08:16.390
-Let's not talk about this. -Actually, all my men

172
08:16.390 --> 08:18.120
are stationed at the frontier.

173
08:18.160 --> 08:19.560
The capital's defenses

174
08:19.560 --> 08:21.890
are all under my elder brother's command.

175
08:22.480 --> 08:23.470
Your Highness,

176
08:23.950 --> 08:25.390
that's a military secret.

177
08:25.390 --> 08:26.800
You can't tell her that.

178
08:26.820 --> 08:28.390
What military secret?

179
08:28.750 --> 08:30.310
Even a fool knows that.

180
08:30.650 --> 08:31.480
-Your Highness. -Your Highness.

181
08:31.480 --> 08:32.120
-Your Highness. -Your Highness.

182
08:32.120 --> 08:32.750
-Get away! -Your Highness.

183
08:32.750 --> 08:33.510
Your Highness.

184
08:33.510 --> 08:34.419
Go!

185
08:43.750 --> 08:45.150
For 17 years...

186
08:48.360 --> 08:49.910
For 17 years,

187
08:50.720 --> 08:52.080
His Majesty has loved watching

188
08:52.080 --> 08:54.740
my elder brother and me fight for the upper hand.

189
08:54.960 --> 08:56.760
-You know that? -Your Highness.

190
08:56.960 --> 08:58.490
It's always been like this.

191
08:58.910 --> 09:00.200
If I lose,

192
09:00.200 --> 09:01.390
His Majesty helps me

193
09:01.390 --> 09:02.990
bring down my elder brother.

194
09:03.720 --> 09:05.960
If His Majesty sees my elder brother losing,

195
09:05.960 --> 09:08.190
he helps him turn the tables.

196
09:08.550 --> 09:10.390
Everyone thinks I'm a fool,

197
09:10.750 --> 09:12.680
but I know exactly what's going on.

198
09:14.150 --> 09:15.210
Tell me, am I a fool?

199
09:16.550 --> 09:18.960
-Am I? Tell me! -Your Highness, you're drunk.

200
09:18.960 --> 09:21.270
-Let's go back to your place. -Say it! Am I a fool?

201
09:21.270 --> 09:22.000
Tell me!

202
09:22.000 --> 09:22.750
Your Highness.

203
09:22.750 --> 09:23.600
Get away!

204
09:23.670 --> 09:24.750
Am I a fool? Tell me!

205
09:24.750 --> 09:25.480
Your Highness.

206
09:25.480 --> 09:25.960
Say it!

207
09:25.960 --> 09:27.390
-Your Highness, you're drunk. -Tell me!

208
09:27.390 --> 09:28.200
Master.

209
09:29.360 --> 09:30.360
Your Highness.

210
09:31.120 --> 09:32.720
-Qingyang. -Your Highness.

211
09:32.960 --> 09:33.750
Qingyang.

212
09:34.750 --> 09:38.270
-Your Highness, take it easy. -Qingyang, you're finally here.

213
09:38.270 --> 09:39.130
Your Highness.

214
09:40.600 --> 09:42.550
Don't you think I'm a fool,

215
09:42.670 --> 09:43.480
Qingyang?

216
09:43.600 --> 09:45.360
Don't you think I'm a fool?

217
09:46.270 --> 09:47.130
Your Highness,

218
09:48.150 --> 09:49.080
you're drunk.

219
09:50.390 --> 09:51.200
Qingyang,

220
09:51.360 --> 09:53.400
I... I can't carry him.

221
09:54.030 --> 09:54.890
Your Highness.

222
09:55.360 --> 09:57.670
I can't carry the Crown Prince either.

223
09:57.770 --> 09:59.670
I'll help His Highness back

224
09:59.870 --> 10:01.320
to the Crown Prince's residence.

225
10:01.320 --> 10:02.840
Master, I've found something regarding

226
10:02.840 --> 10:04.360
what you asked me to look into last time.

227
10:04.360 --> 10:06.320
On the 9th day of the 2nd month in the 20th year of Hongyun,

228
10:06.320 --> 10:07.360
the Ministry of War sent out

229
10:07.360 --> 10:09.910
an urgent military dispatch by express courier.

230
10:09.910 --> 10:11.200
As for the specific contents,

231
10:11.200 --> 10:12.200
I wasn't able

232
10:12.750 --> 10:13.750
to find out.

233
10:15.910 --> 10:17.200
Military intelligence is highly classified,

234
10:17.200 --> 10:18.920
so it was difficult to uncover the details.

235
10:18.920 --> 10:19.960
I don't blame you.

236
10:19.960 --> 10:22.420
That dispatch not only reached His Majesty,

237
10:22.790 --> 10:25.790
but also made its way to the Crown Prince's residence.

238
10:27.080 --> 10:28.940
So that's it—they joined forces.

239
10:30.360 --> 10:31.870
Something else happened that day

240
10:31.870 --> 10:33.200
that shook the realm:

241
10:33.390 --> 10:35.590
Fourth Prince Zhou Yan died of illness.

242
10:35.660 --> 10:36.810
A month later,

243
10:36.840 --> 10:38.080
the First Prince handed over

244
10:38.080 --> 10:39.290
the seal of the Ministry of War.

245
10:39.290 --> 10:40.350
Most of the First Prince's men

246
10:40.350 --> 10:42.550
were replaced by the Crown Prince's men.

247
10:42.550 --> 10:44.970
There were extensive personnel changes.

248
10:48.050 --> 10:49.850
This is the list we've compiled.

249
10:53.630 --> 10:54.200
[Ministry of War Roster]

250
10:54.200 --> 10:55.800
Those marked with a red check

251
10:56.000 --> 10:57.960
are no longer alive.

252
10:59.560 --> 11:01.050
It's only been 17 years,

253
11:02.670 --> 11:04.670
yet so many of them are already dead.

254
11:06.360 --> 11:08.090
Could they have been silenced?

255
11:08.300 --> 11:09.750
[Ministry of War Roster] [Su Wei]

256
11:09.750 --> 11:10.670
There's one person here

257
11:10.670 --> 11:11.720
who isn't marked.

258
11:12.870 --> 11:13.870
Could this person

259
11:14.180 --> 11:15.350
still be alive?

260
11:16.200 --> 11:17.200
This person

261
11:17.200 --> 11:18.870
went to Mingling County in Qingzhou many years ago

262
11:18.870 --> 11:20.730
and disappeared without a trace.

263
11:30.390 --> 11:31.200
Constable Li,

264
11:31.720 --> 11:32.670
the Chief has summoned everyone.

265
11:32.670 --> 11:33.440
The entire Divine Constable Bureau

266
11:33.440 --> 11:35.900
is to convene in the Chief Constable's Hall.

267
11:36.820 --> 11:40.260
[Clear as a Mirror]

268
12:02.200 --> 12:02.960
Everyone,

269
12:03.870 --> 12:06.200
the third black chest has arrived.

270
12:06.600 --> 12:07.360
It was left right

271
12:07.360 --> 12:08.600
at the entrance to the Divine Constable Bureau.

272
12:08.600 --> 12:10.480
We don't know when it was placed there.

273
12:10.480 --> 12:11.540
Open it.

274
12:41.640 --> 12:42.000
[Severe-Cold]

275
12:42.000 --> 12:42.790
Look.

276
12:42.910 --> 12:44.870
The inscription on this sword reads "Severe-Cold."

277
12:44.870 --> 12:46.200
The Severe-Cold Sword?

278
12:46.430 --> 12:48.160
Does this black chest warning mean

279
12:48.160 --> 12:49.560
Meng Rui will kill again?

280
12:56.390 --> 12:58.050
Though the likeness is crude,

281
12:58.600 --> 13:00.200
the pattern on the armor

282
13:00.750 --> 13:01.870
is unmistakable.

283
13:03.720 --> 13:05.120
The plum-dyed Xuan Bird—

284
13:05.200 --> 13:07.750
the insignia of a First-Rank Senior Grand Secretary.

285
13:07.750 --> 13:08.720
That's Grand Secretary Bai.

286
13:08.720 --> 13:09.670
After all,

287
13:09.720 --> 13:10.910
Grand Secretary Bai was the mastermind

288
13:10.910 --> 13:13.710
of the alliance that hunted down Dao Yin back then.

289
13:16.510 --> 13:17.320
Now,

290
13:17.750 --> 13:19.480
Grand Secretary Bai is training troops at the Vanguard Camp

291
13:19.480 --> 13:20.600
outside the city

292
13:20.720 --> 13:22.480
to prepare for Northern Kun's southward advance.

293
13:22.480 --> 13:23.960
All members of the Divine Constable Bureau,

294
13:23.960 --> 13:25.960
you are ordered to leave the city at once and head to the Vanguard Camp.

295
13:25.960 --> 13:27.150
Protect the Grand Secretary

296
13:27.150 --> 13:28.200
at all costs.

297
13:28.600 --> 13:29.390
-Yes! -Yes!

298
13:37.790 --> 13:39.270
The Ministry of Justice is here by imperial order to investigate.

299
13:39.270 --> 13:41.200
No one is allowed in or out.

300
13:43.750 --> 13:44.910
The Divine Constable Bureau

301
13:44.910 --> 13:46.320
operates independently of the Six Ministries.

302
13:46.320 --> 13:47.360
Since when does the Ministry of Justice

303
13:47.360 --> 13:48.240
have the authority

304
13:48.240 --> 13:49.970
to decide whether we come or go?

305
13:54.720 --> 13:56.250
When will the Chief arrive?

306
13:56.960 --> 13:57.960
This is a matter of great importance.

307
13:57.960 --> 13:59.600
The Chief is in the palace seeking His Majesty's permission.

308
13:59.600 --> 14:01.660
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

309
14:02.960 --> 14:04.170
It's finally here.

310
14:04.270 --> 14:06.330
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

311
14:07.750 --> 14:09.790
By the Crown Prince's decree,

312
14:10.080 --> 14:12.390
all members of the Divine Constable Bureau are ordered to enter the Vanguard Camp

313
14:12.390 --> 14:13.320
and protect the Grand Secretary

314
14:13.320 --> 14:14.360
while apprehending the culprit.

315
14:14.360 --> 14:15.270
Do not delay.

316
14:17.120 --> 14:18.150
Do you hear that?

317
14:18.320 --> 14:19.600
Do not delay!

318
14:21.120 --> 14:22.200
Go report this to Lord Xiao.

319
14:22.200 --> 14:22.870
Yes.

320
14:28.200 --> 14:29.390
We're here on urgent business.

321
14:29.390 --> 14:31.480
Please inform

322
14:31.480 --> 14:33.590
the Commander and Cavalry Commander at the Vanguard Camp

323
14:33.590 --> 14:34.790
to come down and receive us.

324
14:34.790 --> 14:36.000
Didn't you hear us?

325
14:36.080 --> 14:36.870
Move!

326
14:40.150 --> 14:40.960
Step aside.

327
14:43.630 --> 14:44.150
Well?

328
14:44.150 --> 14:44.600
[Vanguard]

329
14:44.600 --> 14:45.960
Wasn't I impressive just now?

330
14:45.960 --> 14:47.320
You're formidable, Eunuch Zhao.

331
14:47.320 --> 14:48.120
So,

332
14:48.390 --> 14:49.600
has the Crown Prince awakened?

333
14:49.600 --> 14:51.390
He's still drunk in your room.

334
14:52.120 --> 14:52.910
Eunuch Zhao,

335
14:53.750 --> 14:56.410
you falsely relayed the Crown Prince's decree?

336
14:56.910 --> 14:58.640
Wasn't I doing it for your sake?

337
14:59.960 --> 15:01.390
Thank you, Eunuch Zhao.

338
15:05.120 --> 15:06.380
What's wrong?

339
15:06.510 --> 15:07.600
Are you cold?

340
15:07.860 --> 15:09.480
Why are you trembling?

341
15:09.500 --> 15:10.840
What else? I-I heard that

342
15:10.840 --> 15:11.870
whenever Meng Rui draws that wailing sword,

343
15:11.870 --> 15:12.390
someone dies.

344
15:12.390 --> 15:14.080
If not for the Crown Prince's oral decree,

345
15:14.080 --> 15:15.280
I wouldn't have come.

346
15:15.910 --> 15:16.720
Just remember

347
15:16.720 --> 15:17.960
to protect me later,

348
15:17.960 --> 15:18.670
all right?

349
15:19.270 --> 15:20.080
Eunuch Zhao,

350
15:20.480 --> 15:21.530
should I

351
15:21.720 --> 15:22.960
focus on capturing Meng Rui

352
15:22.960 --> 15:24.640
to earn merit for the Crown Prince,

353
15:24.640 --> 15:26.700
or on protecting you?

354
15:27.630 --> 15:28.440
Well...

355
15:28.670 --> 15:29.790
the Crown Prince's business

356
15:29.790 --> 15:30.850
is more important.

357
15:48.080 --> 15:49.080
Grand Secretary,

358
15:49.120 --> 15:51.320
these soldiers are indeed formidable.

359
15:51.390 --> 15:53.670
They are the finest of the finest

360
15:53.750 --> 15:56.420
from every camp across Great Shi,

361
15:56.870 --> 15:58.750
forged through countless trials.

362
15:58.750 --> 15:59.750
When the two armies clash,

363
15:59.750 --> 16:00.910
they charge fearlessly into battle,

364
16:00.910 --> 16:02.720
fighting solely for Great Shi.

365
16:02.750 --> 16:04.470
With soldiers like these,

366
16:04.750 --> 16:06.510
Great Shi has nothing to fear from Northern Kun's army.

367
16:06.510 --> 16:07.240
Grand Secretary, have you

368
16:07.240 --> 16:08.510
given these newly trained warriors

369
16:08.510 --> 16:09.510
a name?

370
16:11.120 --> 16:14.120
The Soldiers of Sorrow.

371
16:19.010 --> 16:20.680
[Vanguard]

372
16:21.000 --> 16:23.240
Fight! Fight! Fight!

373
16:23.750 --> 16:25.670
"Under Heaven, we are all travelers,

374
16:25.670 --> 16:27.720
united in sorrow beneath the dust of ages."

375
16:27.720 --> 16:29.200
What a fitting name. The Soldiers of Sorrow

376
16:29.200 --> 16:31.550
embodies a spirit as impassioned as a song,

377
16:31.550 --> 16:33.480
treating death as lightly as dust.

378
16:34.200 --> 16:37.150
Are you also from the Divine Constable Bureau?

379
16:38.150 --> 16:39.410
Yes, Grand Secretary.

380
16:39.600 --> 16:40.600
I'm Li Si,

381
16:40.790 --> 16:43.850
a trainee constable with the Divine Constable Bureau.

382
17:00.000 --> 17:01.600
The bell in the black chest warning

383
17:01.600 --> 17:02.910
clearly indicated midnight.

384
17:02.910 --> 17:03.720
Midnight

385
17:04.130 --> 17:05.270
has now passed.

386
17:08.589 --> 17:10.750
My thanks to His Highness the Crown Prince

387
17:10.750 --> 17:13.200
and everyone from the Divine Constable Bureau.

388
17:13.200 --> 17:15.510
My deepest thanks.

389
17:26.750 --> 17:28.410
Protect the Grand Secretary!

390
17:41.240 --> 17:42.030
Where is he?

391
17:46.210 --> 17:47.340
Split up and search!

392
18:05.960 --> 18:07.350
Yan, you stay here.

393
18:07.350 --> 18:08.160
Grand Secretary, come with me.

394
18:08.160 --> 18:08.790
All right.

395
18:11.960 --> 18:12.750
Meng Rui,

396
18:13.480 --> 18:15.790
don't go any further down this wrong path.

397
18:15.790 --> 18:16.590
Meng Rui,

398
18:17.270 --> 18:18.590
why are you doing this?

399
18:23.590 --> 18:24.350
It's you.

400
18:34.440 --> 18:36.350
Grand Secretary, it's safe here.

401
18:39.360 --> 18:41.330
Grand Secretary, rest in peace.

402
19:01.550 --> 19:02.400
Lord Lou,

403
19:03.000 --> 19:04.310
why don't you guess

404
19:05.160 --> 19:06.280
when Meng Rui and I

405
19:06.370 --> 19:08.730
swapped outfits?

406
19:09.310 --> 19:10.590
And when

407
19:10.960 --> 19:13.710
Meng Rui and the Grand Secretary

408
19:14.180 --> 19:15.530
swapped outfits?

409
19:21.880 --> 19:22.790
What if

410
19:22.920 --> 19:24.200
the black chest

411
19:24.350 --> 19:25.350
wasn't merely meant

412
19:25.350 --> 19:27.260
to frame the Netherworld Swordsman,

413
19:27.260 --> 19:29.060
but the warning itself

414
19:29.510 --> 19:30.790
was an essential part

415
19:30.790 --> 19:32.510
of the culprit's plan?

416
19:33.920 --> 19:35.880
If the culprit wants to frame me,

417
19:37.090 --> 19:38.510
their next target

418
19:38.530 --> 19:39.480
must be Grand Secretary Bai—

419
19:39.480 --> 19:40.720
one of the people

420
19:42.880 --> 19:43.830
who hunted down the Old Man back then.

421
19:43.830 --> 19:44.640
Why don't we

422
19:45.160 --> 19:45.790
wait for

423
19:45.790 --> 19:47.480
the third black chest to appear,

424
19:47.480 --> 19:49.880
then turn their plan against them?

425
19:49.880 --> 19:51.940
An oral decree from the Crown Prince!

426
19:53.720 --> 19:54.880
It's finally here.

427
19:58.310 --> 19:59.160
Meng Rui hid

428
19:59.160 --> 20:00.490
among Eunuch Zhao's men

429
20:00.520 --> 20:02.520
and infiltrated the military camp.

430
20:08.180 --> 20:09.910
Grand Secretary, come with me.

431
20:17.940 --> 20:19.200
Lord Lou,

432
20:19.720 --> 20:22.270
you had your men assassinate the Grand Secretary,

433
20:22.270 --> 20:24.500
just as foretold in the black chest warning.

434
20:24.500 --> 20:26.630
But you knew perfectly well

435
20:26.920 --> 20:29.400
that this military camp was full of highly skilled fighters,

436
20:29.400 --> 20:31.330
so your men could never succeed.

437
20:31.680 --> 20:34.180
Your real plan

438
20:34.440 --> 20:35.590
was to use the chaos

439
20:36.110 --> 20:37.970
to take the Grand Secretary away.

440
20:38.110 --> 20:39.070
Then, once the two of you

441
20:39.070 --> 20:40.670
were alone,

442
20:40.740 --> 20:43.740
you would seize the opportunity to kill him.

443
20:44.400 --> 20:45.640
Am I right?

444
20:46.070 --> 20:47.510
So we turned your plan against you

445
20:47.510 --> 20:48.660
and swapped outfits.

446
20:48.660 --> 20:50.000
I disguised myself as Grand Secretary Bai,

447
20:50.000 --> 20:50.880
while Li Si disguised himself as me

448
20:50.880 --> 20:51.880
and drew everyone else away.

449
20:51.880 --> 20:52.480
The goal was to lure the real culprit—

450
20:52.480 --> 20:54.010
you—into making your move.

451
20:59.310 --> 21:01.240
The first two black chest warnings

452
21:01.510 --> 21:03.510
were your doing as well, weren't they, Lord Lou?

453
21:03.510 --> 21:05.110
Your goal

454
21:05.270 --> 21:07.000
was to make everyone believe

455
21:07.240 --> 21:10.240
that the black chest warnings were genuine,

456
21:10.310 --> 21:11.140
that Meng Rui

457
21:12.210 --> 21:14.670
would definitely kill the Grand Secretary.

458
21:14.720 --> 21:15.830
That way,

459
21:16.590 --> 21:18.400
you could openly approach the Grand Secretary

460
21:18.400 --> 21:20.110
under the pretext

461
21:20.130 --> 21:21.130
of protecting him

462
21:24.080 --> 21:25.320
and then kill him.

463
21:29.820 --> 21:31.510
I never thought

464
21:32.090 --> 21:34.070
that despite all my careful planning,

465
21:34.070 --> 21:36.030
I couldn't fool you, Young Master Qingyang.

466
21:36.030 --> 21:37.140
Lou Tianming,

467
21:37.400 --> 21:39.260
we've worked together for years.

468
21:39.270 --> 21:40.440
Why?

469
21:40.440 --> 21:41.920
The victor becomes king, and the loser becomes a bandit. Enough talk.

470
21:41.920 --> 21:42.880
Come at me together.

471
21:42.880 --> 21:43.830
You treacherous bastard.

472
21:43.830 --> 21:44.590
This place is crawling with experts.

473
21:44.590 --> 21:45.720
Do you really think you can escape?

474
21:45.720 --> 21:47.850
Today, I speak for the Eastern Palace—

475
21:50.110 --> 21:51.130
Lou Tianming,

476
21:51.160 --> 21:52.350
surrender!

477
21:52.400 --> 21:53.310
Do you think taking that damn eunuch hostage

478
21:53.310 --> 21:53.920
will save your life?

479
21:53.920 --> 21:55.270
Who are you calling a damn eunuch?

480
21:55.270 --> 21:56.160
Let me tell you:

481
21:56.200 --> 21:57.480
if I lose even a single hair,

482
21:57.480 --> 21:58.640
I'll report you to the Crown Prince

483
21:58.640 --> 22:00.970
and have your entire household executed.

484
22:16.510 --> 22:18.000
I clearly killed them.

485
22:18.590 --> 22:20.320
What the hell are these things?

486
22:20.510 --> 22:22.480
Why won't they die?

487
23:33.830 --> 23:34.920
This beast

488
23:35.240 --> 23:37.270
is one you raised at the Divine Constable Bureau.

489
23:37.270 --> 23:38.680
Naturally, it knows

490
23:38.720 --> 23:40.130
the people of the Divine Constable Bureau

491
23:40.130 --> 23:41.450
are friends, not foes.

492
23:42.510 --> 23:43.830
You've been known as the Constable Eagle

493
23:43.830 --> 23:45.000
for 10 years.

494
23:45.510 --> 23:46.310
How is it

495
23:46.920 --> 23:48.920
that you're not as perceptive as it?

496
23:59.050 --> 24:00.080
It's you people.

497
24:09.110 --> 24:10.770
Protect the Grand Secretary!

498
24:11.510 --> 24:12.900
Protect the Grand Secretary!

499
24:12.900 --> 24:14.560
Protect the Grand Secretary!

500
24:24.590 --> 24:25.270
Meng Rui!

501
24:25.300 --> 24:26.110
Come back!

502
24:26.830 --> 24:27.640
Yan,

503
24:29.090 --> 24:31.350
be careful. Don't let them lure you away.

504
24:56.850 --> 24:59.710
What a fine display of mastery over objects with qi.

505
25:04.050 --> 25:05.300
Greetings, Chief.

506
25:06.270 --> 25:07.530
For the past few years,

507
25:08.480 --> 25:09.270
I've entrusted nearly all the day-to-day affairs

508
25:09.270 --> 25:10.880
of the Divine Constable Bureau

509
25:10.880 --> 25:12.110
to you.

510
25:12.720 --> 25:14.620
Everyone in and out of court says

511
25:14.750 --> 25:15.990
that sooner or later,

512
25:16.220 --> 25:18.170
you'll take my place.

513
25:18.610 --> 25:19.860
Chief,

514
25:20.500 --> 25:22.430
I will never forget your kindness.

515
25:23.250 --> 25:25.110
It's enough that you remember it.

516
25:26.730 --> 25:28.570
You needn't hold back now.

517
25:30.710 --> 25:31.680
In the jianghu,

518
25:32.090 --> 25:33.850
there have been two ten-year periods.

519
25:33.850 --> 25:35.050
In the first,

520
25:35.350 --> 25:37.650
the Netherworld Swordsman tested his swordsmanship against the world.

521
25:37.650 --> 25:38.790
In the second,

522
25:39.120 --> 25:41.760
Chief Xuanyuan reigned supreme.

523
25:42.830 --> 25:44.030
Tonight, I am honored

524
25:44.370 --> 25:47.290
to witness the skills

525
25:47.310 --> 25:49.310
of the greatest female martial artist in history.

526
25:49.310 --> 25:50.850
Greatest of all time

527
25:50.920 --> 25:51.930
is too much.

528
25:52.440 --> 25:53.640
But adding "female"

529
25:53.640 --> 25:55.270
to the title

530
25:55.650 --> 25:57.450
would be looking down on me.

531
25:57.720 --> 25:58.850
You may leave it out.

532
25:59.270 --> 26:01.950
Then, let the greatest martial artist of our time make the first move

533
26:01.950 --> 26:03.650
and show me the legendary technique,

534
26:03.650 --> 26:06.030
"Clouds Veil the Mist, Stars Split the Heavens;

535
26:06.030 --> 26:09.230
Jade Pendants and Gold Ornaments Set the World in Order."

536
27:18.480 --> 27:19.640
Who are you?

537
27:21.430 --> 27:22.640
What are you after?

538
27:22.680 --> 27:23.900
Why did you kill my family?

539
27:23.900 --> 27:24.620
Speak!

540
28:02.240 --> 28:03.030
Come on!

541
28:08.390 --> 28:09.190
Tell me,

542
28:09.310 --> 28:10.750
who are you people?

543
28:10.750 --> 28:11.540
Speak!

544
28:31.920 --> 28:33.140
Brother!

545
28:47.400 --> 28:48.740
[Vanguard]

546
28:50.310 --> 28:51.110
Are you all right?

547
28:51.110 --> 28:51.880
Just sprinkle it on. That should do it.

548
28:51.880 --> 28:52.480
Be careful.

549
28:52.480 --> 28:54.280
Bear with it. It'll be over soon.

550
28:55.000 --> 28:56.070
How is he?

551
28:56.400 --> 28:57.400
He's much better.

552
29:00.310 --> 29:02.440
Zhenzhu, is it okay to tie it like this?

553
29:02.790 --> 29:03.590
No problem.

554
29:04.680 --> 29:05.310
It's done.

555
29:08.320 --> 29:10.490
[Vanguard]

556
29:21.510 --> 29:24.640
Divine Constable Bureau, receive the imperial decree.

557
29:26.590 --> 29:28.250
By His Majesty's oral decree:

558
29:28.590 --> 29:29.400
I have learned

559
29:29.480 --> 29:31.880
of the crimes of Lou Tianming and Meng Rui

560
29:31.900 --> 29:33.220
and am deeply shocked.

561
29:33.350 --> 29:35.880
Three days remain of the seven-day deadline.

562
29:36.030 --> 29:38.430
Lou Tianming has now been apprehended.

563
29:38.480 --> 29:40.480
You are to capture Meng Rui at once.

564
29:40.480 --> 29:42.680
Bring him back alive, or bring back his body.

565
29:42.680 --> 29:43.440
What?

566
29:43.780 --> 29:45.000
The truth is clear.

567
29:45.110 --> 29:46.180
Meng Rui is innocent.

568
29:46.180 --> 29:47.860
We receive the decree.

569
29:52.880 --> 29:53.640
Chief,

570
29:53.640 --> 29:55.070
why do we still have to arrest Meng Rui?

571
29:55.070 --> 29:56.920
Knowing full well that Meng Rui isn't the culprit,

572
29:56.920 --> 29:58.910
are we really going to compound the mistake?

573
29:58.910 --> 30:00.000
If we can establish exactly

574
30:00.000 --> 30:01.240
what happened

575
30:01.240 --> 30:02.830
and give His Majesty and Northern Kun a satisfactory explanation,

576
30:02.830 --> 30:04.430
can Mr. Meng then be cleared?

577
30:04.490 --> 30:05.920
His Majesty wants

578
30:05.940 --> 30:07.640
an explanation

579
30:07.640 --> 30:09.920
that will stabilize the situation for now.

580
30:09.920 --> 30:10.920
I'll return to the Bureau

581
30:10.920 --> 30:13.180
and continue examining Yan Zige's body.

582
30:15.070 --> 30:15.920
Chief.

583
30:15.920 --> 30:17.110
Once you find Meng Rui,

584
30:17.110 --> 30:18.910
sound the whistle as the signal.

585
30:19.590 --> 30:20.400
Yes, Chief.

586
30:32.510 --> 30:34.670
You've been with the Divine Constable Bureau

587
30:34.670 --> 30:36.310
for 13 years.

588
30:38.040 --> 30:41.040
Thirteen years, seven months,

589
30:41.790 --> 30:42.920
and nine days.

590
30:49.590 --> 30:50.480
I've always regarded you

591
30:50.480 --> 30:52.240
as my own younger brother.

592
30:54.110 --> 30:55.030
Why?

593
31:01.110 --> 31:02.830
Attempting to assassinate the Grand Secretary

594
31:02.830 --> 31:04.000
is treason.

595
31:04.310 --> 31:05.750
And then there are the deaths

596
31:05.750 --> 31:06.950
of Wenbu and Yan Zige.

597
31:07.200 --> 31:08.000
No one can save you

598
31:08.000 --> 31:09.930
from the crimes you've committed.

599
31:10.070 --> 31:11.340
If you won't speak now,

600
31:11.370 --> 31:12.550
do you intend to take your secrets

601
31:12.550 --> 31:13.680
to the grave?

602
31:15.610 --> 31:17.070
Everyone has a grave

603
31:19.080 --> 31:21.040
in their heart.

604
31:22.780 --> 31:23.920
The Divine Constable Bureau

605
31:23.920 --> 31:26.110
has 49 forms of torture.

606
31:26.510 --> 31:29.370
Are you saying you'd like to experience them today?

607
31:32.000 --> 31:33.720
Thirteen of those

608
31:34.830 --> 31:36.400
were devised by me.

609
31:36.720 --> 31:38.030
I wonder which one

610
31:38.530 --> 31:40.400
I'll survive today.

611
31:52.790 --> 31:53.590
Guards!

612
31:53.590 --> 31:54.400
Yes.

613
31:54.400 --> 31:55.920
Take good care of him.

614
31:55.920 --> 31:56.550
Yes.

615
32:04.030 --> 32:05.510
His Majesty issued the decree

616
32:05.510 --> 32:07.110
right after you finished interrogating Lou Tianming.

617
32:07.110 --> 32:08.510
Effective immediately,

618
32:08.790 --> 32:10.050
the Eastern Palace, the Ministry of Justice,

619
32:10.050 --> 32:11.510
and the Court of Judicial Review

620
32:11.510 --> 32:14.030
may all enter the prison to interrogate Lou Tianming.

621
32:14.030 --> 32:16.110
Only the Divine Constable Bureau is forbidden from doing so.

622
32:16.110 --> 32:17.820
We're to merely keep watch over him.

623
32:17.820 --> 32:18.450
Wait,

624
32:19.710 --> 32:21.580
is His Majesty afraid we'll show favoritism,

625
32:21.580 --> 32:22.950
or does he suspect the Divine Constable Bureau?

626
32:22.950 --> 32:24.010
Watch your tongue.

627
32:25.000 --> 32:26.200
But Lou Tianming

628
32:26.200 --> 32:27.310
spent years in the Divine Constable Bureau.

629
32:27.310 --> 32:29.070
He knows interrogation inside out.

630
32:29.070 --> 32:30.310
With those people from the Eastern Palace

631
32:30.310 --> 32:31.030
and the Ministry of Justice,

632
32:31.030 --> 32:33.230
what could they possibly get out of him?

633
32:33.610 --> 32:34.880
What exactly are those things

634
32:34.880 --> 32:35.880
under Lou Tianming?

635
32:35.880 --> 32:37.270
What is his real plot?

636
32:37.270 --> 32:38.830
And what about Wenbu and Yan Zige?

637
32:38.830 --> 32:40.480
So many questions remain unanswered.

638
32:40.480 --> 32:42.880
Are we really just going to leave it at that?

639
32:43.670 --> 32:44.470
Yan,

640
32:45.730 --> 32:46.970
His Majesty said

641
32:47.110 --> 32:48.590
we're not allowed to interrogate him.

642
32:48.590 --> 32:49.590
He never said

643
32:50.110 --> 32:51.970
we couldn't keep investigating.

644
32:53.150 --> 32:53.950
That's true.

645
33:11.750 --> 33:12.860
Master.

646
33:12.880 --> 33:14.440
We can't keep Mr. Meng

647
33:14.440 --> 33:15.510
here forever.

648
33:17.490 --> 33:19.720
Before Senior Old Geezer left,

649
33:19.800 --> 33:21.200
he said there was nothing he could do

650
33:21.200 --> 33:22.730
about Mr. Meng's injuries.

651
33:22.820 --> 33:24.470
If we want to save Mr. Meng,

652
33:25.070 --> 33:28.270
the only hope is Mr. Tao from the Divine Constable Bureau.

653
33:29.490 --> 33:31.550
Yuque has ordered Meng Rui's arrest.

654
33:31.920 --> 33:33.120
We can't send him back

655
33:33.310 --> 33:35.310
to the Divine Constable Bureau now.

656
33:35.930 --> 33:36.740
Not unless

657
33:38.160 --> 33:40.020
I can uncover the truth

658
33:40.310 --> 33:41.510
and clear his name.

659
33:46.810 --> 33:48.560
The heart is protected by the breastbone.

660
33:48.560 --> 33:50.170
No matter how profound Meng Rui's inner power was,

661
33:50.170 --> 33:51.110
even if one strike

662
33:51.110 --> 33:52.480
could shatter Yan Zige's heart meridians,

663
33:52.480 --> 33:53.680
there was no way

664
33:53.680 --> 33:55.080
he could strike his heart

665
33:55.140 --> 33:57.000
through completely intact ribs.

666
33:57.740 --> 33:59.180
If the culprit really

667
33:59.200 --> 34:00.960
wanted to recreate the effect of the murder warning,

668
34:00.960 --> 34:02.550
they would have had to calculate exactly

669
34:02.550 --> 34:04.750
when Wenbu would take the poison and when it would take effect,

670
34:04.750 --> 34:06.310
down to the last detail.

671
34:06.960 --> 34:09.360
Yan Zige's death was even more mysterious.

672
34:09.510 --> 34:11.110
No one could have predicted in advance

673
34:11.110 --> 34:11.960
which move Meng Rui would use

674
34:11.960 --> 34:13.030
to kill Yan Zige.

675
34:13.670 --> 34:14.550
And there are

676
34:14.550 --> 34:15.590
no ghosts or gods in this world

677
34:15.590 --> 34:17.440
capable of foreseeing the future.

678
34:17.440 --> 34:18.710
Unless...

679
34:29.960 --> 34:30.770
This is...

680
34:32.060 --> 34:34.659
A belly feather from a Western Migrant Bird...

681
34:35.530 --> 34:36.989
A Western Migrant Bird

682
34:37.020 --> 34:38.560
grows only 1 belly feather in its lifetime.

683
34:38.560 --> 34:40.800
As fine as a strand of hair yet extraordinarily tough,

684
34:40.800 --> 34:42.190
it can travel through the blood vessels

685
34:42.190 --> 34:42.530
and sever the heart meridians.

686
34:42.530 --> 34:43.880
[Clear as a Mirror]

687
34:43.880 --> 34:45.960
If Yan Zige had been secretly attacked by someone else,

688
34:45.960 --> 34:47.150
he could never have chosen this moment

689
34:47.150 --> 34:48.260
to duel Meng Rui.

690
34:48.800 --> 34:49.590
Unless

691
34:50.550 --> 34:51.710
Yan Zige was the one who drove this feather

692
34:51.710 --> 34:53.190
into his own body.

693
34:55.550 --> 34:57.510
The human body is riddled with blood vessels,

694
34:57.510 --> 34:58.550
yet you managed

695
34:58.680 --> 34:59.560
to find

696
34:59.590 --> 35:00.800
such a tiny feather.

697
35:01.130 --> 35:03.090
Zhenzhu, you did well.

698
35:05.770 --> 35:06.880
He drove the feather

699
35:06.880 --> 35:08.840
into his own body,

700
35:08.860 --> 35:10.530
which means Yan Zige killed himself.

701
35:10.530 --> 35:12.100
That explains everything.

702
35:13.000 --> 35:14.230
The reason his death

703
35:14.280 --> 35:16.260
looked exactly like the black chest warning

704
35:16.260 --> 35:17.090
is simply

705
35:17.280 --> 35:18.810
that Yan Zige killed himself.

706
35:18.810 --> 35:20.390
Yan Zige willingly took his own life

707
35:20.390 --> 35:21.840
to make us completely believe

708
35:21.840 --> 35:23.240
the black chest warning.

709
35:23.320 --> 35:25.110
Combined with the assassination attempt,

710
35:25.110 --> 35:26.760
it becomes clear that Lou Tianming planned everything so carefully

711
35:26.760 --> 35:28.190
simply to make us believe

712
35:28.190 --> 35:29.670
that the Grand Secretary

713
35:34.360 --> 35:35.690
would be the next to die.

714
35:35.800 --> 35:37.730
Once the Divine Constable Bureau believed the warning,

715
35:37.730 --> 35:39.600
we were bound to protect the Grand Secretary.

716
35:39.600 --> 35:42.880
Lou Tianming could then seize the opportunity to assassinate him.

717
35:42.880 --> 35:44.940
To assassinate the Grand Secretary,

718
35:45.360 --> 35:48.190
they went to such lengths and devised such an elaborate trap.

719
35:48.190 --> 35:50.850
They certainly went to great lengths to plan it.

720
35:51.940 --> 35:53.780
If the Grand Secretary were to die,

721
35:53.780 --> 35:55.340
Northern Kun could launch

722
35:55.370 --> 35:56.710
an all-out war without restraint.

723
35:56.710 --> 35:57.510
Qingyang.

724
36:00.000 --> 36:01.000
Chief.

725
36:01.150 --> 36:02.070
You're back.

726
36:02.150 --> 36:03.680
Where have you been all day?

727
36:04.880 --> 36:06.190
Thank you for your concern, Chief,

728
36:06.190 --> 36:07.590
and both of you.

729
36:08.190 --> 36:09.480
I've been searching

730
36:09.550 --> 36:11.150
for Mr. Meng's whereabouts.

731
36:11.810 --> 36:12.730
Any leads?

732
36:18.800 --> 36:20.530
Then let's get back to the case.

733
36:20.880 --> 36:22.590
Based on what we just deduced,

734
36:23.050 --> 36:24.720
Yan Zige committed suicide.

735
36:25.390 --> 36:26.590
But what about Wenbu?

736
36:26.960 --> 36:28.190
Just like Yan Zige,

737
36:28.920 --> 36:30.760
Wenbu would have had to take the poison himself

738
36:30.760 --> 36:32.510
so that the time of death

739
36:32.510 --> 36:33.640
could be pinpointed

740
36:33.800 --> 36:35.110
and his body

741
36:35.190 --> 36:37.720
would match the black chest warning exactly.

742
36:37.920 --> 36:40.000
Suicide by Yan Zige is one thing,

743
36:40.020 --> 36:42.320
but Wenbu was the Crown Prince of Northern Kun.

744
36:42.320 --> 36:44.180
He was willing to risk his own life

745
36:45.190 --> 36:47.420
just to provoke a war between the two sides?

746
36:47.420 --> 36:48.790
For years,

747
36:49.190 --> 36:51.000
tensions had been simmering between us and Northern Kun.

748
36:51.000 --> 36:52.930
War is a test of national strength,

749
36:53.000 --> 36:54.070
and over time,

750
36:54.360 --> 36:55.490
many in Northern Kun

751
36:55.590 --> 36:57.710
had come to favor peace.

752
36:57.880 --> 36:58.970
But now

753
36:59.280 --> 37:00.880
that the Crown Prince is dead,

754
37:00.880 --> 37:02.860
the peace faction in Northern Kun

755
37:02.930 --> 37:04.190
has been silenced.

756
37:05.190 --> 37:06.400
The entire nation

757
37:06.590 --> 37:07.780
is united against us

758
37:08.130 --> 37:09.710
and launches a massive invasion of the south.

759
37:09.710 --> 37:10.990
But even

760
37:11.480 --> 37:13.510
if Northern Kun wins,

761
37:13.590 --> 37:14.900
the Crown Prince is still dead.

762
37:14.900 --> 37:16.260
What would be the point?

763
37:16.480 --> 37:17.740
It doesn't make sense.

764
37:19.040 --> 37:20.730
Corpse-Dissolving Powder.

765
37:21.470 --> 37:22.360
No wonder.

766
37:22.920 --> 37:24.360
Once the body dissolved,

767
37:24.360 --> 37:26.910
it would be impossible to determine the true identity.

768
37:26.910 --> 37:28.110
The man who died

769
37:28.110 --> 37:29.640
wasn't Crown Prince Wenbu.

770
37:30.110 --> 37:31.150
It was a substitute.

771
37:31.150 --> 37:33.670
Yan Zige took his own life. Wenbu died.

772
37:34.150 --> 37:35.710
The two nations went to war,

773
37:36.100 --> 37:37.430
and no one could stop it.

774
37:37.510 --> 37:38.440
At the same time,

775
37:38.630 --> 37:39.900
if the Grand Secretary were to die,

776
37:39.900 --> 37:41.720
Northern Kun's chances of victory would increase dramatically.

777
37:41.720 --> 37:43.720
That was their motive.

778
37:44.510 --> 37:45.360
But what exactly is Lou Tianming

779
37:45.360 --> 37:46.620
trying to accomplish?

780
37:47.150 --> 37:48.880
What does he stand to gain

781
37:48.960 --> 37:51.190
from a war between Northern Kun and Great Shi?

782
37:51.190 --> 37:52.190
That is something

783
37:52.550 --> 37:54.880
we'll have to ask Lou Tianming ourselves.

784
37:55.150 --> 37:55.960
Chief.

785
37:57.360 --> 37:58.280
Chief,

786
37:58.400 --> 37:59.860
Lou Tianming has escaped.

787
38:03.460 --> 38:04.300
Chief.

788
38:14.150 --> 38:15.150
How could this have happened?

789
38:15.150 --> 38:16.360
He was tortured

790
38:16.540 --> 38:18.210
and had no way of escaping on his own.

791
38:18.210 --> 38:19.880
Someone must have tampered with things.

792
38:19.880 --> 38:21.130
It's no easy feat for an outsider

793
38:21.130 --> 38:22.160
to get into the Divine Constable Bureau,

794
38:22.160 --> 38:24.120
let alone get someone out.

795
38:25.230 --> 38:26.030
Could there be

796
38:26.700 --> 38:28.240
a mole within the Divine Constable Bureau?
